// A sum or difference as KIELER writes it into C, `x = - -c[0]`. KIELER runs it: x is 0, 3, 2; c is [4,7], [3,7],
// [2,7].
scchart Main { input bool b input int i int a[2] = {4,7} int c[2] = {4,7} int m[2][2] = {{4,7},{8,1}} float fa[2] bool ba[2] output int x output float f output bool y initial state A do x = - -c[0] go to A }
